{"version":1,"key":"card:233","content":{"id":233,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"剩余参数是将多个独立的参数合并为一个数组，而展开运算符则相反，向一个数组展开为一个个独立的参数。一些需要借助 apply 方法传递参数的方案现在可以使用展开运算符替代了。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例如对于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Math.max","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，该方法接收多个数字参数，返回其最大值，当参数的个数比较少时可以还算容易使用，当需要比较的参数较多时，一般我们会将参数放置在一个数组中然后传入，但是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Math.max","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不接收数组，它只接收一个个独立的参数"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"Math.max([1, 3, 5, 4]); // ❌\nMath.max(1, 3, 5, 4);   // ✅","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"afcc4c0e-ef72-4a0b-8d39-69d6bb2765d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们通过会借助于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"apply","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，因为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"apply","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法是将方法的参数合并为数组传入的"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"Math.max.apply(Math, [1, 3, 5, 4]);","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0dc46869-949e-4a78-add5-8c992af65fbf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 ES6 中提供了展开运算符，可以直接将数组展开为一个个的独立参数进行传入"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"Math.max(...[1, 3, 5, 4]);","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"bfedd191-1503-4310-a569-c6971e8318b2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相比于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"apply","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，写法上更加清晰，而且有的时候会将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"apply","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"call","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 混淆，有记忆的负担。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1690901823920,"updateTime":1753698105204,"linkedCards":[{"id":227,"target":{"key":"card:227","type":"card","id":227},"summary":"我们可以使用 ... 对集合进行展开 const arr = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]; const set = new Set([1, 2, 3, 4, 5]); const map = new Map([['a', 1], ['b...","tags":["JavaScript"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1753698105204}}